      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ASTON BOREALIS (2) was strongly supported last start when a short priced favourite and duly saluted winning by 6 lengths at Geelong in a handy 22.59. Draws to advantage and in form and has the ability. Comes through a solid form race last start. Sure to prove hard to beat. LOVELY LAINEY (1) broke from the inside draw and filled a minor placing last start, beaten only 1.2 lengths (23.39) behind Warrior Page at this track. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings four times from six attempts. Nicely placed to grab a well-deserved win. STORM COMING (7) unfancied latest but hit the ground running and gave a sight, holding on for a minor placing (24.34) at Traralgon in a Grade 5 over 425m. Overdue and gets his chance. SHOULD BE QUEEN (3) can sneak into the finish.",
